{
  "id": "28293_hakaru",
  "headword": "{量|はか}る",
  "reading": "はかる",
  "romaji": "hakaru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (godan)",
  "gloss": "to weigh; to measure (volume or weight)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to weigh; to measure (weight or volume)",
      "explanation": "To measure how much something weighs or its volume, typically using a scale or measuring vessel."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "28293_hakaru_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{体重|たいじゅう}→体重：03395_taijuu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{量|はか}る。",
      "english": "To weigh oneself.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28293_hakaru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{砂糖|さとう}→砂糖：00884_satou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{百|ひゃく}→百：00780_hyaku⟧⟦グラム→グラム：01354_guramu⟧{量|はか}った。",
      "english": "I measured out 100 grams of sugar.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28293_hakaru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{宅配便|たくはいびん}→宅配便：09534_takuhaibin⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦{出|だ}す→出す：01087_dasu⟧⟦{前|まえ}→前：02255_mae⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧、⟦{荷物|にもつ}→荷物：00737_nimotsu⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{重|おも}さ→重さ：14444_omosa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{量|はか}っておく。",
      "english": "Weigh the package before sending it by parcel delivery.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28293_hakaru_ex4",
      "japanese": "⟦{米|こめ}→米：01323_kome⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦カップ→カップ：01077_kappu⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{量|はか}って⟦{炊|た}いた→炊く：02127_taku⟧。",
      "english": "I measured the rice with a cup and cooked it.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "Kanji variant of はかる reserved for weight and volume. For length, depth, or speed use ⟦{測|はか}る→測る：01977_hakaru⟧; for time or set-phrase 'planning' use ⟦{計|はか}る→計る：28292_hakaru⟧.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{体重|たいじゅう}→体重：03395_taijuu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{量|はか}る: to weigh oneself\n- ⟦{重|おも}さ→重さ：14444_omosa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{量|はか}る: to measure the weight\n- ⟦{分量|ぶんりょう}→分量：05474_bunryou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{量|はか}る: to measure out a quantity\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{測|はか}る→測る：01977_hakaru⟧: to measure length, depth, height, speed\n- ⟦{計|はか}る→計る：28292_hakaru⟧: to measure time; to plan",
